# engine/MANIFEST). Order matters: macros, structs, components and special variables before their
# users. tuning / rules / control / kit are plain CL (host-tested); yama / ken / rukia are the characters
# (data + hooks + cinematics); fighter ... main are the generic systems (no character names, except debug.lisp's test scenarios).
